You decided to bet on the element of surprise, jumped out from the cover and rushed away by long jumps. The police men held back because of the suddenness, but in a few seconds sounded gunfire. Suddenly, the Moon disappeared behind the clouds. For your luck the street lights were out and pitch darkness covered the neighbourhood. You  almost managed to reach a safe lane, when suddenly one of the bullets hit you.  You lamentably squealed, and after covering a few more yards, dropped on the spot. 
"We need to check it out. Everybody, come with me," ordered one of the policemen. Moving extremely cautiously and holding guns ready to shoot, law and order guardians approached the place you fell. 
"It's clear guys! There is some naked redneck here. We probably hit him while were shooting the beast. Call the ambulance."
"Where did he come from?"
"I bet he visited somebody's wife and her husband came home earlier. So he jumped off the balcony."
"What's there on his neck?"
"Looks like a cell phone"
"What a queer devil. If I were in his shoes, I'd better grab my trunks." 
The ambulance arrived quite fast. The doctors verified death of the victim, then took the body and drove it to morgue.